<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{order}}" class="report"><view class="report-head"><view class="brand">车鉴 INSPECT</view><view class="report-title">车辆检测记录报告</view><view class="report-id">{{order.id}}</view></view><view class="report-section"><view class="section-title">一、车辆基本信息</view><view class="info-grid"><view>品牌车型：{{order.vehicle.brandModel||'—'}}</view><view>车牌号码：{{order.vehicle.plate||'—'}}</view><view>VIN：{{order.vehicle.vin||'—'}}</view><view>首次上牌：{{order.vehicle.firstRegister||'—'}}</view><view>表显里程：{{order.vehicle.mileage||'—'}} km</view><view>车身颜色：{{order.vehicle.color||'—'}}</view></view></view><view class="report-section"><view class="section-title">二、检测进度</view><view>记录状态：{{statusText}}</view><view>已记录项目：{{order.inspection?order.inspection.done:0}} / {{order.inspection?order.inspection.total:0}}</view><view>现场照片：{{photoCount}} 张</view></view><view class="report-section"><view class="section-title">三、专项检测记录</view><view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="title" class="group"><view class="group-title">{{item.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="check" wx:key="name" class="result"><view class="result-top"><text>{{check.name}}</text><text class="result-state">{{check.state}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{check.note}}" class="muted note">{{check.note}}</view><view wx:if="{{check.photos.length}}" class="photos"><image wx:for="{{check.photos}}" wx:for-item="photo" wx:key="*this" src="{{photo}}" mode="aspectFill" data-src="{{photo}}" bindtap="preview"/></view></view></view></view><view class="disclaimer">本页为本机演示记录，不是正式鉴定评估报告。检测结论、标准条款映射、审核签名及机构盖章尚未启用。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="exportHint">报告导出（开发中）</button></view><view wx:else class="empty">未找到该订单，请返回订单列表。</view></view>